<title>UK: Merrill Lynch sets 10 mln calls on SBC.</title>
<headline>Merrill Lynch sets 10 mln calls on SBC.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-04-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Merrill Lynch Capital Markets AG, Zurich said it had issued 10 million American-style call warrants, on Swiss Bank Corp.</p>
<p>One share is controlled by 20 warrants.</p>
<p> STRIKE PRICE    325 CHF		   PREMIUM	8.88PCT</p>
<p> ISSUE PRICE     1.20 CHF (INDIC)	GEARING	13.66 X</p>
<p> EXERCISE PERIOD 19.MAY.97-17.APR.98   PAYDATE	14.MAY.97</p>
<p> LISTING	   SWISS EXCHNGE (APPL)  SPOT REF     320 CHF</p>
<p> MIN EXER	  100</p>
<p> PRICES QUOTED ON REUTER PAGE     MLCHF3</p>
<p>--Reuter London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
